"P3825274252" "If you have stuff to store, I'm here.<br><br>You're smart not to trust Imperial Bank of Praetoria.  Who knows where your stuff'll end up?  I have all the secure storage compartments you'll need right here so your Invention Salvage will be safe.  You can find storage locations in the Nova Praetoria, Imperial City, and Neutropolis sectors of the Underground.<br><br>Stay vigillant."
